stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Ready
  Ready --> Playing: Start
  Playing --> Paused: Pause or tab hidden
  Paused --> Playing: Resume
  Playing --> GameOver: Collision
  GameOver --> Playing: Play Again / reset state
  GameOver --> Ready: Back to Start
  Playing --> Ready: Back to Start
  note right of Paused: Animation loop and obstacle/audio are paused
  note right of GameOver: Loop is cancelled and final score is announced
